    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d885">

                <pb facs="1033" n="1021" sameAs="frus:frus1943v02/pg1021"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">860H.01/534: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador to the Yugoslav Government in Exile</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Biddle</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-09-15T13:00:00+01:00">September 15,
                            1943—1 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received September 15—12:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>23. Yugoslav Series. King Peter yesterday left London for Cairo accompanied by
                    the members of his Government.</p>
                <p>They expect to arrive in about a fortnight, and the Government will thereafter be
                    established in Cairo instead of in London.</p>
                <closer>[<signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Biddle</hi>
                    </signed>]</closer>
            </div>
